{"type":"message","id":"e532aac3","parentId":"5e7683db","timestamp":"2026-04-22T06:40:24.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API key is being used but it's returning a 403 forbidden. The API key might be invalid, expired, or lack permissions. Let me check the key format - it starts with `sk-cp-` which is an Anthropic API key format. But the 403 suggests the key might not have the right permissions or is invalid.\n\nActually wait - looking at the error more carefully, it says \"Request not allowed\". This could mean the API key doesn't have permission for the Claude Code usage, or the key is a different type (maybe it's a subscription key but doesn't have API access).\n\nLet me verify the API key is correct by checking if it works with a direct API call. But actually, I don't want to expose the key further. \n\nThe user's key might be incorrect or they may have provided the wrong one. The `sk-cp-` prefix suggests this is a Claude API key from the Anthropic developer console, which should work for Claude Code, but the 403 indicates the key itself isn't authorized for this particular request.","thinkingSignature":"f3a04ad18f707bbea0f6f1d7f8b8dde6b1603db911ece99aa56b82779cb7f9db"},{"type":"text","text":"API Key 验证失败了，返回了 403 禁止访问错误。这个 Key 可能无效或过期了。\n\n你确认这是正确的 Anthropic API Key 吗？可以到 https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys 检查一下 Key 是否还有效。\n\n或者如果你有新的 Key，可以发给我重新配置。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8527,"output":276,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41637,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776840011345,"responseId":"0637a04b6bb8fdfc0fbc0a954848fb8e"}}
